								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://masslinemedia.com/smf/index.php?topic=286.msg4242#msg4242">Is &quot;Flavor of Love&quot; just trashy TV or demeaning minstrelsy?</a></b>
									<div class="smalltext">&#171; <b> on:</b> November 08, 2006, 05:10:55 am &#187;</div></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
